✅ File: `/home/administator/workspace/create_idea/sessions/20261024_201620/worktrees/e1/e4/正方辩手模块.py` (190+ lines)\n- ✅ Current debate topic capability: Supports any topic via keyword matching\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n**Technical Issues Found & Resolved:**\n- Original file had full-width Chinese punctuation (，、。【】「」) causing SyntaxError on line 245\n- Solution: Applied global replace for all Chinese punctuation to half-width equivalents\n\n**Architecture Decisions:**\n- Keyword-based topic detection (simple string matching)\n- Category-specific 论据 generation with data/case/value layers\n- Default fallback for unrecognized topics: \"支持 {辩题内容}\"\n\n**Supported Debate Topics:**\n1. AI/人工智能 → AI as tool not replacement\n2. 科技 → Improves quality of life\n3. 传统 → Cultural heritage & wisdom\n4. 教育 → Practical training > theory\n5. 合作 → Win-win collaboration\n6. 环境/可持续发展 → Sustainable future\n7. 创新 → Drives social progress\n\n## 4. Active Context\n**Environment:**\n- Workspace: `/home/administator/workspace/create_idea/sessions/20261024_201620/worktrees/e1/e4`\n- Connected modules: 主持人模块 (e2), 反方辩手模块 (e6)\n- Debate project: e1\n\n**Current State:**\n- 正方辩手模块 ready to receive debate topic via `理解辩题()` method\n- `准备论据()` generates structured 论据库 with 5 categories\n- No specific debate topic assigned yet (module initialized with empty 辩题)\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Host module needs to pass debate topic to positive辩手 via `理解辩题()`\n- 反方辩手模块 exists for counter-arguments (not yet implemented)\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **High Priority**: Integrate with 主持人模块 to receive debate topic dynamically\n2. **Medium Priority**: Add similar enhancement to 反方辩手模块 for counter-arguments\n3. **Low Priority**: Add user input mechanism for custom debate topics\n4. **Verification**: Test with real debate topic from host module\n\n**Blockers:**\n- No specific debate topic provided by user yet\n- Need host module to trigger topic assignment\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n**User Preferences:**\n- Argume